1
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:10,810
Nanfeng,

2
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,000
I got you a new phone.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,730
The password is your birthday.

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,290
You can change it later.

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,160
Phones nowadays

6
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,580
are so convenient.

7
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,690
You don't have to go
to a restaurant to eat.

8
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,410
You can order delivery.

9
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,560
They'll deliver it right

10
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,760
to where you are.

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,800
If anyone gives you bad service,

12
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:29,890
see this?

13
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,160
Just click here

14
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:31,890
to complain.

15
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,560
One complaint

16
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,120
and they'll come crying back to beg you.

17
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,250
Do complaints work?

18
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,280
Of course they do.

19
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,280
One complaint is enough
to make them suffer.

20
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,540
Can you complain about a prosecutor too?

21
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,730
What do you mean?

22
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:47,890
Nothing.

23
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:50,610
Have fun.

24
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:52,960
By the way,

25
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,560
after all these years,

26
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,600
why haven't you found yourself a wife?

27
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,600
A lot has happened

28
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,340
in the past nine years.

29
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,130
Mom and Dad are gone.

30
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,140
And you were still inside.

31
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,040
I didn't have the heart for it.

32
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,500
Let's not talk about this.

33
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:11,140
I've been feeling unsettled lately.

34
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,930
I don't want to stay in Beitan anymore.

35
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,740
Why are you leaving
right after getting out?

36
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,210
Don't worry.

37
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,289
I'll take care of you

38
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,560
and make sure you have
everything you need.

39
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,600
That's not what I meant.

40
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:26,440
I just feel...

41
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:27,960
I just feel

42
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:28,960
uneasy.

43
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:30,940
Did you find

44
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:32,720
the person I asked you

45
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,560
to look for?

46
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,200
Find who?

47
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,479
They couldn't find anyone

48
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:37,009
at the place you mentioned.

49
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,160
Her name is

50
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,440
Liu Qian.

51
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:40,600
Who is she?

52
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,600
A friend of yours?

53
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:42,680
Sort of.

54
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:43,770
Alright,

55
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,220
I'll keep looking.

56
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,560
Do you want to make big money?

57
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
You just got out and
you already have a way to make big money?

58
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,080
Work with me.

59
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,380
Your money tree is right here.

60
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:01,920
How is it?

61
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,800
Are you having fun at school?

62
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,330
Yes, I am.

63
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:04,800
Son!

64
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,160
Dad!

65
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,680
You little rascal.

66
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:13,680
You're

67
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,480
so busy with work.

68
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,850
I can pick up Zixuan.

69
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,160
I can't let you do that.

70
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,620
He's my only precious son.

71
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,520
Of course I have to pick him up myself,

72
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:21,920
right?

73
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:22,920
So,

74
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,520
what do you want to eat?

75
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,400
Tell me, it's my treat.

76
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,360
Long live Dad!

77
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,940
Think about what you want.

78
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:30,560
So,

79
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,160
how have you been lately?

80
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:32,920
Same old.

81
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,160
Still in the inpatient department.

82
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,320
How many years will it take
to get promoted?

83
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:39,800
If it doesn't work out,

84
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,760
just come work for me.

85
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:41,600
My business has been doing okay

86
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,800
these past few years.

87
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,360
If he joins us,
we definitely won't treat him badly.

88
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:45,760
Right?

89
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,280
Right.

90
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,040
Think about it.

91
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,040
Brother-in-law,

92
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:51,200
you know I don't have much ambition.

93
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:54,400
I'm perfectly fine
just being a pediatrician.

94
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,360
If Zixuan ever gets a fever or something,

95
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,690
I can take a look, right?

96
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:58,840
Besides,

97
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,580
my sister's matter

98
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,080
still isn't settled.

99
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,440
I'm in no mood
to think about anything else.

100
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:06,960
Zixuan

101
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:08,040
Zixuan

102
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:08,960
Long time no see.

103
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,240
I'm Aunt Lin.

104
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,040
Why didn't you tell me you were coming?

105
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,480
No, why are you here?

106
00:03:16,480 --> 00:03:18,079
I'm your girlfriend.

107
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,840
I couldn't find you anywhere,

108
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,720
so I had to come catch you here.

109
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,920
Did you miss me?

110
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:24,240
I did.

111
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:24,720
Well...

112
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,079
Brother-in-law,

113
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,940
we'll wait for you over there.

114
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:30,970
Coming, coming.

115
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,010
Let's go.

116
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,060
What are you doing?

117
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:37,480
Stop it.

118
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,340
We're outside.

119
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:39,240
Honey,

120
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,720
I missed you so much.

121
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,000
Why don't you look happy

122
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,640
to see me?

123
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,000
I am.

124
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,520
I'm very happy right now.

125
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,560
Alright, alright.

126
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,360
Stop talking.

127
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,280
Just go back.

128
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,360
Let me have a meal with the kids,

129
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:48,800
okay?

130
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,570
I'll drive then.

131
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,480
Let me give you a ride.

132
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,410
No need, no need.

133
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:56,079
Just go, go, go.

134
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:08,120
Hello?

135
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,320
9:00 PM tonight at Longxi Road.

136
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,650
I'll be waiting for you.

137
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,960
Who is this?

138
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,890
Everyone, come take a look.

139
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:21,600
This is the video

140
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,130
my master copied back then.

141
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,080
It's the mall's surveillance footage.

142
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:27,640
It was taken about a week
before the incident.

143
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,800
This video

144
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,480
looks like Zhao Nanfeng

145
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,640
scouting the place
in advance for Zhou Yawen.

146
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,370
Look closer.

147
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,210
She's staring at the child.

148
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,409
She's not scouting.

149
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,200
You're right.

150
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,120
Her eyes never left the child.

151
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:51,520
They're probably more than just

152
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,800
business partners.

153
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:53,760
Bosses,

154
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,960
I have some thoughts.

155
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,640
Go ahead.

156
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:59,080
It'll take some time
to recover the hard drive.

157
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,880
How about we dig into the past?

158
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,040
Let's follow the clue

159
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:04,440
about Zhou Yawen's child.

160
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,660
We might find something unexpected.

161
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,840
Kaixin has made great progress.

162
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,440
You can draw inferences now.

163
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,020
Tell us more

164
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,680
about what you're thinking.

165
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,160
I can't really explain it.

166
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,080
It's just...

167
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,280
intuition.

168
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:20,320
If you think I'm wrong,

169
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,180
just forget it.

170
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,370
How can we forget it?

171
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,480
Sometimes solving a case

172
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,680
relies on intuition.

173
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:26,240
It's a good idea.

174
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,700
We don't have any new clues
right now anyway.

175
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:29,680
Let's give it a try.

176
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,280
Okay.

177
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,610
Kaixin and I will go to the hospital

178
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,409
to check on Zhou Yawen's child.

179
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,370
Alright, go.

180
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,840
The mother's name is Zhou Yawen, right?

181
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,200
Yes.

182
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,120
Could you please check

183
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,480
who the delivering doctor was?

184
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,480
The one who delivered Zhou Yawen's baby

185
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,240
was Wang Li.

186
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,200
Is it 'Li' as in 'beautiful'?

187
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,080
Yes,

188
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,410
'Li' as in 'beautiful'.

189
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,650
Okay, thank you.

190
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,690
You're welcome.

191
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,120
Wei,

192
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,800
your notes from back then

193
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,080
said it was a premature birth,

194
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,440
but the computer record just now

195
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,900
showed a full-term birth.

196
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,060
Looks like we need to find Wang Li.

197
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:16,610
Let's go.

198
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,480
Xinxin,

199
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,920
where are you?

200
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,860
Stop playing hide-and-seek with Mommy.

201
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,200
Xinxin,

202
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,400
look at the time.

203
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,680
It's time to eat.

204
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,800
Is it fun?

205
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,159
Why are you feeding our kid

206
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:56,040
random stuff?

207
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:56,980
Who are you?

208
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,080
Long time no see.

209
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,880
Didn't you say you weren't home?

210
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,450
If I hadn't lied,

211
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,580
how would I get a chance to see you?

212
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,720
Do we really have to come to this?

213
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,840
We've said everything.

214
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,100
The papers are signed.

215
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,000
What you're doing now

216
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,330
is really unnecessary.

217
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,000
I regret it.

218
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,450
I still can't figure it out.

219
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:54,200
Why do you insist on divorcing me?

220
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,080
What did I do wrong?

221
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:55,720
Tell me,

222
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,980
and I'll change, okay?

223
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,570
You're fine.

224
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,450
There's nothing to change.

225
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,480
Is it because I

226
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,000
ignored your feelings before?

227
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:07,560
Yishan,

228
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:09,880
I

229
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,410
really didn't know.

230
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,160
I really

231
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,540
didn't know you were sick.

232
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,720
Why do you have my medicine?

233
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:25,640
Yishan,

234
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:27,960
I'm sorry.

235
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,680
I didn't pay

236
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,039
enough attention to you before.

237
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,200
I really regret it now.

238
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,039
What kind of person would I be

239
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,320
if I left now?

240
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,049
What would the kids think of me?

241
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:42,650
Can you give me another chance?

242
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,050
Let me take good care of you.

243
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:48,840
My illness is not the reason
we're separating.

244
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,820
I'll take good care of myself.

245
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,570
If you have time,

246
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,850
pay more attention to your son.

247
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,480
Move.

248
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,200
Can you take care of yourself

249
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,560
without me?

250
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,700
I admit I haven't cared enough

251
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,290
for the family these years.

252
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,920
Twenty years.

253
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,480
We've been married for 20 years.

254
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,780
From college till now,

255
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,250
are you just going to throw it all away?

256
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,460
When did you become so heartless?

257
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,960
Jiang Yuan,

258
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,220
let's end this with some dignity.

259
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,280
Open the door.

260
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:13,220
Who are you?

261
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,250
What do you want?

262
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,050
What did you do to my son?

263
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,120
Your son?

264
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,720
Mr. Gu.

265
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,920
You're ridiculous.

266
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,960
As a man, I pity you.

267
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:44,720
Wipe that smirk off your face.

268
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:45,720
Spit it

269
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,400
out.

270
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:50,820
Take a look.

271
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,210
What does this mean?

272
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,620
Your wife has more secrets

273
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,800
than you think.

274
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,000
Remember

275
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,160
Wang Li,

276
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,420
the midwife

277
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:08,940
when your son was born?

278
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,880
Your wife bought her off a long time ago.

279
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,800
He wasn't premature.

280
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,280
He was full-term.

281
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:17,800
To put it bluntly, that son isn't yours.

282
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,400
Don't talk nonsense to me.

283
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,840
Do you think a few words

284
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:28,040
can change my relationship with my son?

285
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,460
Don't rush, Mr. Gu.

286
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,640
There's more.

287
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,520
Mr. Gu,

288
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,610
you're worth tens of millions.

289
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:48,840
If

290
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:51,120
someone else's son inherits it,

291
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,080
I'd feel bad for you.

292
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:01,120
You're talking nonsense.

293
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:04,520
Trying to scam me with this?

294
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,080
You're too green.

295
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,000
Fine.

296
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,240
Mr. Gu.

297
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,200
But I have

298
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,120
a big mouth.

299
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:20,000
I can't keep a secret.

300
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,400
You're a man of status.

301
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,080
If

302
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,400
any rumors spread,

303
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,340
I'm afraid it'll hurt our relationship.

304
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,570
Is this everything?

305
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,100
Why should I trust you?

306
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:37,720
Mr. Gu,

307
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,160
we value integrity.

308
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:47,680
What a happy childhood.

309
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,640
The stuff is in the trunk.

310
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:55,660
Take the money.

311
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:56,880
Shut up.

312
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,360
Get lost.

313
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

314
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,360
Hello.

315
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:07,080
Find a lab to test Zixuan's DNA.

316
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:08,500
And look into someone.

317
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:14,200
Nanfeng

318
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:15,480
Nanfeng

319
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,320
A whole

320
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,400
2 million.

321
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,520
He paid up without a fuss.

322
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:21,880
He knows what's good for him.

323
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:24,880
Nanfeng,

324
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,760
how did you know

325
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,520
that kid isn't his?

326
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:31,920
You don't need to know that.

327
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:34,320
Fine.

328
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,840
He won't call the police, will he?

329
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,600
No way.

330
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,320
People with money and status like him

331
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,450
care about their reputation the most.

332
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,560
Makes perfect sense.

333
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:45,200
That's my sister.

334
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,920
You've been smarter than me
since we were kids.

335
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,440
Stepping over that fire pan
wasn't for nothing.

336
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,720
You're a phoenix rising from the ashes.

337
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,760
Oh

338
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:51,880
my god.

339
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:54,440
There will be plenty of chances
for you to make big money.

340
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,240
This little bit of money is nothing.

341
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,300
It's just peanuts.

342
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,480
I have to admire your vision.

343
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,770
It'll take me years to catch up.

344
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:08,200
Should we leave town for a while?

345
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:10,960
Not yet.

346
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:15,360
I still have something important to do.

347
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,480
Zhou Yajun is a doctor now.

348
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,240
After Zhou Yawen passed away,

349
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:25,240
he kept in touch with his brother-in-law.

350
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,500
He often helps take care of Gu Zixuan now.

351
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:31,000
Gu Zhicheng also remembers
Zhou Yawen's death.

352
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,800
Overall, their family is

353
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,890
quite loyal and affectionate.

354
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,280
Little sidekick,

355
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,720
we meet again.

356
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,810
What are you doing here?

357
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:47,920
Here?

358
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,000
Well, isn't this...

359
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,400
Is this Zhou something's house?

360
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,160
Zhou Yajun.

361
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,060
What are you doing at Zhou Yajun's house?

362
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,680
Why so nervous?

363
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,240
Can't I come see him?

364
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:03,880
After all, I took
his sister's money back then.

365
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,460
I should apologize to him.

366
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,800
What do you think of this excuse?

367
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:14,600
Zhao Nanfeng,

368
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,760
do you really think

369
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:18,880
no one knows what's

370
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:19,720
on your mind?

371
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,600
A new face,

372
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,130
yet you know my name.

373
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:28,320
What?

374
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:30,360
You people from the procuratorate

375
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:32,320
are taking turns investigating me?

376
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:32,840
Fine.

377
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,720
Tell me what's on my mind.

378
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,120
What are you trying to do?

379
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,840
Don't think I don't know
what happened between you two

380
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:39,640
just because Zhou Yawen is dead.

381
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,260
You're really investigating me?

382
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,690
What's the meaning of this?

383
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,600
You're just not going
to let my family go, are you?

384
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,320
You won't stop until
you make us miserable, right?

385
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,840
If you two weren't women,

386
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,720
I'd teach you a lesson.

387
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,580
Who are you trying to intimidate?

388
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:58,000
Let's talk

389
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:00,730
when we get back.

390
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:03,960
Okay.

391
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:05,360
Great.

392
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:08,440
Investigate whatever you want.

393
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:12,840
I wish you

394
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:13,640
success.

395
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:31,040
They're looking for Zhou Yajun too.

396
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:32,520
Looks like

397
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:34,320
they're not going to let this go.

398
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,360
And Zhou Yajun

399
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:38,480
is clearly trying to ruin me.

400
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,130
There's no end to this mess.

401
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,290
Let's go.

402
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:52,680
I had a fight with Zhou Yawen at the time.

403
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,560
I admit I got physical.

404
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:57,040
That's probably where

405
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,700
the blood in the car came from.

406
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,040
Why did you fight?

407
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,160
Did you tip off Gu Zhicheng

408
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,599
behind my back?

409
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,240
You did it on purpose, didn't you?

410
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,599
We agreed to catch them
in the act together.

411
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:14,640
And now look at you.

412
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:17,319
You get to play both the good guy
and the bad guy, right?

413
00:17:17,319 --> 00:17:19,359
You ungrateful wretch.

414
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,280
I treated you so well,

415
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:23,880
and you turn around and falsely accuse me.

416
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,810
When did I ever falsely accuse you?

417
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:28,400
Don't you know

418
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,260
how much money you've made off me?

419
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:32,040
You're just a parasite.

420
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:33,400
If it weren't for me,

421
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:35,440
you would've starved
on the streets long ago.

422
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:36,240
Let me ask you.

423
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:38,200
Are you and Gu Zhicheng

424
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,080
having an affair too?

425
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,040
Shut up!

426
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:45,680
Zhao Nanfeng,

427
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,840
how dare you hit me!

428
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,480
Get out.

429
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,760
I don't want to see you.

430
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,360
The blood traces in the back seat

431
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:54,290
match Zhao Nanfeng's confession.

432
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:57,640
Just you wait.

433
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:11,280
Zhou Yawen didn't take her bag
when she got out of the car.

434
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,240
Zhao Nanfeng took the card from the bag

435
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,760
and stole 480,000 from it.

436
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,940
The theft charge is established.

437
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,040
After kicking Zhou Yawen out,

438
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:21,800
Zhao Nanfeng drove away.

439
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:34,400
1.6-liter displacement,
six liters per 100 kilometers.

440
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,880
The fuel tank is 55 liters.

441
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,880
According to the police investigation,

442
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,240
Zhao Nanfeng started with a full tank.

443
00:18:40,440 --> 00:18:41,840
She said she kept driving

444
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:42,960
at about 80 km/h

445
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,360
for 90 minutes.

446
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:47,040
Normally, that would only use
about eight or nine liters.

447
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,480
But this car used
nearly 19 liters of fuel.

448
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,680
Why is the fuel consumption double?

449
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:57,560
But if we add the body dumping site,

450
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:58,880
the fuel consumption matches up.

451
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,880
Zhao Nanfeng's confession

452
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:02,240
basically matches the scene investigation,

453
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,760
except the fuel consumption
doesn't add up.

454
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:04,880
But Zhao Nanfeng

455
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,640
offered no explanation for this.
